Third-party assets

Gun models, CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), re-oriented, scaled and re-exported for the game:
- "RG-6 Grenade Launcher" by Sassiska
  (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/rg-6-grenade-launcher-d911c28d568c4dec838d67760f323d98), modified:
  leaf and front sights removed, the reflex sight below added

Gun models, CC0 1.0 on the project owner's statement of 2026-11-05 (no author or page is recorded in the downloads):
- Minimi, B&T SPR 300 and Honey Badger: reflex sight fitted, sights, handles and optics removed, SPR 300 mesh reduced

Reflex sight on the four guns, CC0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/):
- "Red Dot Sight" by Jean PFP (https://opengameart.org/content/red-dot-sight), recoloured, red dot added

The shells, bomblet, rocket, 40 mm grenade, gas canister, stasis emitter, mines, recoilless rifle, turrets, dispenser, radar and floodlight were generated for this project by its owner with Tripo (paid membership).

Effect textures:
- Kenney Particle Pack (CC0)
- Kenney Smoke Particles (CC0)
- "Smoke Aura" by Beast (CC0)
- Unity Labs free VFX image sequences (CC0)

Sounds, converted for the game:
- Sonniss GameAudioGDC bundles
- Boom Library
- freesound.org
- "Sci-fi Grenade Launcher" by ValhallaProject, CC BY 4.0 (https://freesound.org/people/ValhallaProject/sounds/771167/)
- "2 High Quality Explosions" by Michel Baradari, apollo-music.de, CC BY 3.0 (https://opengameart.org/content/2-high-quality-explosions)

Every clip and its source is listed in `Audio/LICENSE.forge`; every model and texture in `Models/LICENSE.forge`.
